<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30892" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰδωλο-ποιία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>formation of images</i>,
			as in a mirror, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				46a
			</span></i>; or by painters, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Criti.</u>
				107b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>image formed in the mind, imagination</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.96
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				15.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>putting of words into the mouth of one dead</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aphth.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>production of mental images</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				2.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>manufacture of idols</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.28
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
